ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kishore Seendripu","x":"There are a number of announced investments where there is a lot of AI at the edge and AI-enabled network infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/maxlinear-mxl-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MXL 2026 Q1","e":"mxl","d":"2026-04-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kishore Seendripu","x":"The rates of ramps will never match data centers, but you now see interest to move toward AI in the DU side of the network at the edge on the wireless side as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/maxlinear-mxl-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MXL 2026 Q3","e":"mxl","d":"2026-10-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kishore Seendripu","x":"As the ongoing AI infrastructure build out momentum continues and as AI data center clusters continue to scale to unprecedented size and bandwidth requirements, we believe MaxLinear is emerging as a key enabler of next generation connectivity technologies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/maxlinear-mxl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MXL 2026 Q3","e":"mxl","d":"2026-10-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kishore Seendripu","x":"Against this backdrop, our AI data center business continues to outperform our expectations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/maxlinear-mxl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MXL 2026 Q3","e":"mxl","d":"2026-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kishore Seendripu","x":"Obviously, we live in a world where we want to attach our own TIA to our own DSP for selfish reasons beyond just a great performance advantage and cost saving for our own customers in terms of power efficiency and the total BOM efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/maxlinear-mxl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,6934,0,0,0,5188,1289],[38,1,6343,0,0,0,5